Subject: Re: Phi matrix vs. Psi matrix
Message-ID: <nl5Y-HJzkxc.dSUSNr1BAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <nl5Y-HJzkxc.uijxDy2HAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
